s.html?mobilesearchterms=2025","source_title":"UMKC Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The mascot is associated with campus and sporting-event spirit activity.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umkc-blue-and-gold-week","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Blue and Gold Week","title":"Mark UMKC’s anniversary week","subtitle":"Late October campus-and-city celebration","notes":"Check the university calendar during the last week in October and choose an event that fits your schedule. Activities have included arts, athletics, service and alumni programs.","short_summary":"A long-standing late-October tradition commemorating UMKC’s anniversary.","evidence_claim":"UMKC describes Blue and Gold Week as a long-standing tradition during the last week in October that commemorates the university’s anniversary.","source_url":"https://www.umkc.edu/about/traditions.html?mobilesearchterms=2025","source_title":"UMKC Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"UMKC says activities take place on both campuses and around Kansas City during the last week in October.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umkc-regalia-run","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Annual Regalia Run","title":"Look for the Regalia Run","subtitle":"A Blue and Gold Week annual event","notes":"Watch Blue and Gold Week announcements for the annual Regalia Run and follow the event’s posted participation details. It is one of the named activities in UMKC’s anniversary-week program.","short_summary":"The annual Regalia Run is a named component of UMKC’s Blue and Gold Week.","evidence_claim":"UMKC lists the annual Regalia Run among the activities held for Blue and Gold Week.","source_url":"https://www.umkc.edu/about/traditions.html?mobilesearchterms=2025","source_title":"UMKC Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check current Blue and Gold Week event details before participating.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umkc-traditions-challenge","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Traditions Challenge","title":"Document your Traditions Challenge","subtitle":"A photo-based UMKC experience checklist","notes":"Enroll through RooGroups, photograph each completed item, and submit your progress there. The challenge is designed to connect participants with campus and Kansas City experiences.","short_summary":"UMKC’s challenge asks students to document distinct traditions and experiences.","evidence_claim":"UMKC instructs participants to sign up in RooGroups, take photos while completing list items and submit those photos to track progress.","source_url":"https://www.umkc.edu/students/traditions-challenge.html","source_title":"UMKC Traditions Challenge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Registration and photo submission are handled through RooGroups; review current challenge requirements there.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umkc-traditions-keeper-ceremony","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Traditions Keeper Ceremony","title":"Earn Traditions Keeper status","subtitle":"A graduation-year celebration for challenge completers","notes":"If you complete the Traditions Challenge, follow the listed graduation-semester deadline and contact the program as directed. Eligible graduating students are invited to the annual celebration.","short_summary":"Graduating students who finish the challenge can be recognized as Traditions Keepers.","evidence_claim":"UMKC says graduating students who complete the Traditions Challenge are invited to a celebratory ceremony each year as Traditions Keepers.","source_url":"https://www.umkc.edu/students/traditions-challenge.html","source_title":"UMKC Traditions Challenge","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"UMKC lists completion deadlines of March 31 for spring graduation and October 31 for fall graduation.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
